    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">You are being swarmed!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Send the hostile waves of worms back into the void <strong>solo or in 2 player online co-op</strong>!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Deceptively simple physics-based core mechanics...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combine the simplicity of homing auto-attacks with the impact of dash attacks, telekinetic blasts, pebbles and wide pulling areas...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Emerging together into overwhelming combos with superpowers!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each and every varied level reward superpower choice can combo with core mechanics, spiraling everything out of control... sometimes against you... The superpowers are all very intense and powerful and are meant to be felt through gameplay, without any stats or numbers</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">And unlockable mutations.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Alter how core mechanics behave, combine many mutations together after unlocking each one by winning...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Everything is a double-edged sword and a mystery to understand through extremely fast-paced action</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Be prepared for the consequences and learn from them as you dodge frenzied  enemies\u00a0pinballing all over the map!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><i>Feedback and Bug Reports</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game was built entirely from scratch\u2014without an engine\u2014using procedural, asset-free GPU-side graphics, solo. While we've tested thoroughly and incorporated past feedback, occasional issues may arise. <u><i><strong>Your bug reports are invaluable</strong></i></u>! Please report any graphics, sound, networking, or performance issues on Discord or the Steam Forums, and we'll address them as quickly as possible!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Bonus</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A swarm simulation mode for when you just want to watch</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">You are being swarmed!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Send the hostile waves of worms back into the void <strong>solo or in 2 player online co-op</strong>!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Deceptively simple physics-based core mechanics...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combine the simplicity of homing auto-attacks with the impact of dash attacks, telekinetic blasts, pebbles and wide pulling areas...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Emerging together into overwhelming combos with superpowers!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each and every varied level reward superpower choice can combo with core mechanics, spiraling everything out of control... sometimes against you... The superpowers are all very intense and powerful and are meant to be felt through gameplay, without any stats or numbers</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">And unlockable mutations.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Alter how core mechanics behave, combine many mutations together after unlocking each one by winning...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Everything is a double-edged sword and a mystery to understand through extremely fast-paced action</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Be prepared for the consequences and learn from them as you dodge frenzied  enemies\u00a0pinballing all over the map!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><i>Feedback and Bug Reports</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game was built entirely from scratch\u2014without an engine\u2014using procedural, asset-free GPU-side graphics, solo. While we've tested thoroughly and incorporated past feedback, occasional issues may arise. <u><i><strong>Your bug reports are invaluable</strong></i></u>! Please report any graphics, sound, networking, or performance issues on Discord or the Steam Forums, and we'll address them as quickly as possible!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Bonus</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A swarm simulation mode for when you just want to watch</p>",
    "short_description": "SSS is a wildly fast-paced solo/duo co-op survivorslite with superkinetic combat, endless mayhem combo potential, unique overpowered non-stat-boost item upgrades and very fast runs. Mutate and slam invasive worms back into the void with telekinetic blasts, void rifts and frenzying hexes!",
